    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>After a long day at work</strong>, your only goal was to get home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But your night turns into a nightmare</strong> when you wake up trapped inside a <strong>forgotten mansion</strong>, lost somewhere between <strong><i>reality</i></strong> and <strong><i>dreams</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a vast, mysterious mansion full of hidden paths and secrets.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve simple puzzles to unlock new areas and find your way out.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings based on your choices and actions.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimal jumpscares \u2014 fear comes from atmosphere and tension.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep, immersive sound design to pull you into the nightmare.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No monsters under your bed.</strong> <i>Only behind every door.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>After a long day at work</strong>, your only goal was to get home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But your night turns into a nightmare</strong> when you wake up trapped inside a <strong>forgotten mansion</strong>, lost somewhere between <strong><i>reality</i></strong> and <strong><i>dreams</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a vast, mysterious mansion full of hidden paths and secrets.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve simple puzzles to unlock new areas and find your way out.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings based on your choices and actions.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimal jumpscares \u2014 fear comes from atmosphere and tension.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep, immersive sound design to pull you into the nightmare.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No monsters under your bed.</strong> <i>Only behind every door.</i></p>",
